. *==============================================================
. * SETUP: two-period DiD, fiscal year end 2018 (pre) vs 2019 (post)
. *==============================================================
. encode gvkey, gen(firm_id)

. 
. gen fyr = fyeyear

. * the paper uses fiscal years 2011-2020 everywhere
. keep if fyr >= 2011 & fyr <= 2020
(5,979 observations deleted)

. 
. * Detrending: fit a CA-specific linear trend on the years before 2018, keep t
> he residuals
. gen ca_year = ca*fyr

. * not from class: i.fyr = year dummies (same fit as tab fyr, gen(yrdum)); kep
> t as Sophia wrote it
